{"sections":[{"slug":"Zariski景","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Zariski景"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Zariski 景"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴上配备</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">单位分解</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">给出的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形的单位分解</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是对应的环中生成单位理想的一族元素</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为交换环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathsf{Alg}_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的范畴</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $A\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">记对偶范畴中相应的对象为</span> $\\operatorname{Spec} A$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> <strong>Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathsf{Alg}_k^{\\mathrm{op}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备如下</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>"}},{"Plain":": $\\operatorname{Spec} A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的覆盖是一族态射</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec} A[a_i^{-1}] \\to \\operatorname{Spec} A,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">满足</span> $1\\in (a_1,\\cdots,a_n)$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结构层</span></h3>\n<p>Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">景上有典范的结构</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它是局部环层</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}